{%- comment -%}
  Cesky nazev pravni zasady.

  Shopify pojmenovava zasady podle jazyka obchodu, takze dokud je obchod
  anglicky, vraci "Terms of service". Nazev proto bereme z mapy, kterou
  si obsluha obchodu muze prepsat v nastaveni sekce.

  Pouziti:
    {% render 'os-nazev-zasady', zasada: zasada, mapa: section.settings.policy_names %}

  Parametry:
    zasada — objekt zasady (ma .url a .title)
    mapa   — radky ve tvaru "handle | Cesky nazev"

  Kdyz handle v mape neni, vrati se puvodni nazev od Shopify.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign handle = zasada.url | split: '/policies/' | last | split: '?' | first | split: '#' | first -%}
{%- assign nazev = zasada.title -%}

{%- assign radky = mapa | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
{%- for radek in radky -%}
  {%- assign casti = radek | strip | split: '|' -%}
  {%- assign klic = casti[0] | strip -%}
  {%- if klic == handle and casti[1] != blank -%}
    {%- assign nazev = casti[1] | strip -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{{- nazev -}}
